<title>USA: Tropical storm heads for Vietnam, floods possible.</title>
<headline>Tropical storm heads for Vietnam, floods possible.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, MASS. 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tropical Storm Ernie is moving southwestward across the South China Sea and is expected to make landfall in Vietnam in the next 36-48 hours with top winds near 40 mph, Weather Services Corp said.</p>
<p>The main threat from this storm will be from heavy rain and flooding once the storm reaches land.</p>
</text>
